{
  "answer": "To deploy a FastAPI application in a Docker container, you can use Docker Compose in a single server, a Kubernetes cluster, a Docker Swarm Mode cluster, another tool like Nomad, or a cloud service that takes your container image and deploys it. For a simple process, you can build your own image from scratch to run a single Uvicorn process, which is suitable for using a distributed container management system like Kubernetes. For more details, refer to the chapter on FastAPI in Containers - Docker. [deployment/server-workers-14]",
